      <p class="text-theme-secondary mb-4">
        These are the tolerances a factory quotes by default. Everything is negotiable on volume: a 200-panel monthly contract can get ±2 mm cutting and ±3% wire diameter written in. What you cannot do is enforce a tolerance you never stated—so state it.
      </p>
